# ========== REMOTE LISTS — maintainers rebuild these daily ==========
# Johnshall: EasyList + EasyList China + Peter Lowe, Shadowrocket format (~56k, rebuilt 00:00 UTC+8)
RULE-SET,https://johnshall.github.io/Shadowrocket-ADBlock-Rules-Forever/sr_ad_only.conf,REJECT
# HaGeZi Pro Mini: DNS ad/tracker domains (~51k). Plain domain list → DOMAIN-SET.
DOMAIN-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hagezi/dns-blocklists/main/wildcard/pro.mini-onlydomains.txt,REJECT
# anti-AD: extra DNS ads (~99k, Surge DOMAIN-SUFFIX — valid RULE-SET)
RULE-SET,https://anti-ad.net/surge.txt,REJECT
